-- Delaware General Corporation Law, 8 Del. C. ch. 1, Subchapter IX -- piece dg7 (ss 255 to 262).
-- Source: de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt, a plain-text rendering made by a converter script; it is not the
