--
-- THE PROVISION UNDER WHICH A TRANSACTION IS EFFECTED -- the one noun that s 261(a) and s 262(b) share.
-- Both sections list the provisions of this Subchapter (and of ss 266, 267 and 390) under which a merger,
-- consolidation, conversion, transfer, domestication or continuance is effected, and each reads the list in
-- its own way (s 261(a) lists the mergers it EXCLUDES; s 262(b) lists the transactions it INCLUDES).
-- The list is a plain fact about the case ("under which section was our merger effected?"), so it is
-- declared once here, and each section's own rule says what it makes of it.

§ `dg7 The provision under which a transaction is effected`

-- src:1244 | Any agreement of merger or consolidation governed by § 251 of this title, other than a merger effected pursuant to § 251(g), § 252, § 254, § 255, § 256, § 257, § 258, § 263 or § 264 of this title …
-- src:1253 | Appraisal rights shall be available for the shares of any class or series of stock of a constituent, converting, transferring, domesticating or continuing corporation in a merger, consolidation, conversion, transfer, domestication or continuance to be effected pursuant to § 251 (other than a merger effected pursuant to § 251(g) of this title), § 252, § 254, § 255, § 256, § 257, § 258, § 263, § 264, § 266 or § 390 of this title …
-- src:1260 | (3) In the event all of the stock of a subsidiary Delaware corporation party to a merger effected under § 253 or § 267 …
@ref 8 Del. C. § 261(a) (src:1244); § 262(b) (src:1253); § 262(b)(3) (src:1260)
DECLARE `dg7 Provision under which a transaction is effected` IS ONE OF
    `a merger or consolidation under s 251 other than a merger under s 251(g)`
    `a merger under s 251(g)`
    `a merger or consolidation under s 252`
    `a merger of a parent corporation and its subsidiary under s 253`
    `a merger or consolidation under s 254`
    `a merger or consolidation under s 255`
    `a merger or consolidation under s 256`
    `a merger or consolidation under s 257`
    `a merger or consolidation under s 258`
    `a merger or consolidation under s 263`
    `a merger or consolidation under s 264`
    `a conversion under s 266`
    `a merger of a parent entity and its subsidiary under s 267`
    `a transfer, domestication or continuance under s 390`
    `a transaction effected under none of the provisions that s 261 and s 262 name`
